--
Regression for LinkedHashMap (and inherited HashMap) copy
constructor.

Pre-fix: HashMap(Map m) ignored m and produced an empty map
with nondet size; LinkedHashMap inherited the bug. Verification
of `new LinkedHashMap<>(src).get(key)` matching src.get(key)
silently failed because dst was empty.

Post-fix: when the source is a HashMap (incl. LinkedHashMap),
the constructor uses non-overlapping System.arraycopy to copy
the backing keys[] and values[] arrays.
